,\"description\":\"Add teammates, assign roles, and get everyone working in the same workspace.\"},{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"Import projects from another tool\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/knowledge-base/import-from-another-tool\",\"description\":\"One-click import from common trackers, with field mapping handled for you.\"},{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"Workspace basics: spaces, projects, and tasks\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/knowledge-base/workspace-basics\",\"description\":\"Understand how PYNGYN organizes work so your team can find anything fast.\"},{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"How to describe a goal so PYNGYN plans it well\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/knowledge-base/describe-a-goal\",\"description\":\"Write goals the AI understands, and get a sharper plan on the first try.\"},{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"Working with timelines and dependencies\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/knowledge-base/timelines-and-dependencies\",\"description\":\"Set up dependencies so the schedule reflects how the work actually flows.\"},{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"Editing and refining an AI-generated plan\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/knowledge-base/edit-the-ai-plan\",\"description\":\"The AI drafts, you decide. Reshape any plan to fit how your team works.\"},{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"How AI risk detection works\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/knowledge-base/risk-detection\",\"description\":\"PYNGYN reads workload and dependencies to flag what threatens your deadline, early.\"},{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"Keeping status current automatically\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/knowledge-base/auto-status\",\"description\":\"Let PYNGYN derive status from the work itself, so the board is never stale.\"},{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"Asking Pyng, your AI assistant\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/knowledge-base/ask-pyng\",\"description\":\"Get quick answers about your plan and PYNGYN without leaving your workspace.\"},{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"Connect Slack to PYNGYN\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/knowledge-base/connect-slack\",\"description\":\"Push status updates and risk flags into the channels your team already watches.\"},{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"Connect QuickBooks for billing\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/knowledge-base/connect-quickbooks\",\"description\":\"Sync clients, invoices, and time entries so billable work flows straight into your books.\"},{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"Sync milestones to Google Calendar\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/knowledge-base/connect-calendar\",\"description\":\"Keep deadlines where your team plans their day.\"},{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"Comments, mentions, and notifications\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/knowledge-base/comments-and-mentions\",\"description\":\"Keep conversation next to the work and loop in the right people.\"},{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"Sharing plans with clients and stakeholders\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/knowledge-base/share-with-clients\",\"description\":\"Give the right people a clean, read-only view of progress.\"},{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"Set up SSO and SAML\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/knowledge-base/sso-setup\",\"description\":\"Configure single sign-on so your team logs in securely with your identity provider.\"},{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"Roles and permissions explained\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/knowledge-base/roles-and-permissions\",\"description\":\"Control who can view, edit, and manage across your workspace.\"},{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"How PYNGYN handles your data\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/knowledge-base/data-and-privacy\",\"description\":\"Where your data lives, how it's protected, and the controls you have.\"},{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"Fixing common import issues\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/knowledge-base/import-issues\",\"description\":\"What to check when an import doesn't map the way you expected.\"},{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"An integration isn't syncing, what to do\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/knowledge-base/integration-not-syncing\",\"description\":\"Step-by-step checks to get a connection working again.\"},{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"Notifications aren't arriving\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/knowledge-base/notifications-not-arriving\",\"description\":\"Common reasons alerts go quiet, and how to turn them back on.\"}]},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/knowledge-base#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Knowledge base\",\"item\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/knowledge-base\"}]},{\"@type\":\"ItemList\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/knowledge-base#itemlist\",\"name\":\"Knowledge base articles\",\"itemListOrder\":\"https://schema.org/ItemListOrderAscending\",\"numberOfItems\":21,\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Create your first project in PYNGYN\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/knowledge-base/create-your-first-project\",\"description\":\"Go from a one-line goal to a full plan with tasks, owners, and a timeline in minutes.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Invite your team and set roles\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/knowledge-base/invite-your-team\",\"description\":\"Add teammates, assign roles, and get everyone working in the same workspace.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Import projects from another tool\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/knowledge-base/import-from-another-tool\",\"description\":\"One-click import from common trackers, with field mapping handled for you.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Workspace basics: spaces, projects, and tasks\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/knowledge-base/workspace-basics\",\"description\":\"Understand how PYNGYN organizes work so your team can find anything fast.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"How to describe a 